>Zero Transfer Time :&nbsp;</b>0ms AC to DC switching ensures uninterrupted power delivery to your router or modem—no reboots or disconnections.</li><li><b>Wide Compatibility :&nbsp;</b>Works seamlessly with Wi-Fi routers, modems, ONTs, IP cameras, VoIP systems, and other 5V to 24V devices.</li><li><b>Safe &amp; Efficient Design :&nbsp;</b>Features V-0 flame-resistant housing, built-in protection circuits, and air-cooled heat dissipation.</li><li><b>Compact &amp; Wall-Mountable :&nbsp;</b>Slim, lightweight design (only 488g) makes it easy to install anywhere—at home, in an office, or even in network cabinets.</li></ul><p><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Marsriva KP4 10000mAh – Mini Smart DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp4-10000mah--mini-smart-dc-ups","now":"2,190৳","old":"2,400৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva KP3 EC 8400mAh – Mini Smart DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp3-ec-8400mah-%E2%80%93-mini-smart-dc-ups","now":"2,200৳","old":"2,300৳","single":""},{"name":"MARSRIVA KP9 Pro 24000mAh Smart Mini DC UPS for Router","href":"/marsriva-kp9-pro-24000mah-smart-mini-dc-ups-for-router","now":"11,290৳","old":"12,000৳","single":""},{"name":"MARSRIVA KP7 Pro 24000mAh Smart Mini DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp7-pro-24000mah-smart-mini-dc-ups","now":"7,490৳","old":"8,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva KP6 EC 8000mAh- Mini Smart DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp6-ec-%E2%80%93-mini-smart-dc-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"2,150৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf1200-1200va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF1200/MR-UF1200-500x-(2)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF1200 1200VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","width":10